        "strategy": {
          "stock": "Scale in only on confirmed support/accumulation; avoid chasing an extended green candle. Increase exposure after a high-volume close above confirmation.",
          "option": "Use options only when spot confirms direction; prioritize delta, IV, theta, open-interest concentration and spread liquidity. Avoid buying high-IV calls solely because copper is bullish.",
